# fix

> TypeScript door for Fix / Fix My Company style repair work. Sister of fixerup (already wrapped).

## Purpose
Explain fix as the software-repair shelf. Source: fitzyracing1/fix.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Take a broken software situation.
2. Repair it.
3. Keep the TypeScript files in this repo.
4. Use fixerup if you want the Base44 app face.

## Key ideas
- Fix (repair)
- TypeScript source
- Sister of fixerup

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/fix
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to fitzyracing1/fix”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the Base44 app → fixerup
- If a reader wants this TS shelf → stay here

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on a repair door.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source, or fixerup.
